      "portrait": "1930s Shanghai yuefenpai calendar-poster illustration portrait of a 26-year-old Chinese man, Republic-era Shanghai 1936, the only son of a wealthy banker, tall and pale, youthful smooth face with delicate brows, glossy slicked-back hair, loosened silk tie and a cream three-piece Western suit, nicotine-stained fingers holding a cigarette, restrained brooding expression, soft airbrushed watercolor shading, Art Deco ornament border, half-length portrait",
